{
  "id": "610",
  "title": "Bus to the Library",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-10-20",
  "synopsis": "Ben asks which bus goes to the library.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/865/46181cf79a650c32e571e113b3b17427ba64176f.mp3?1574950840",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "3路车去图书馆吗\n\n本：你好！请问3路车去图书馆吗？\n公交司机：不去。去图书馆可以坐5路车、7路车和8路车。\n本：好的。\n公交司机：啊，但是今天是周日，没有5路车。7路车早上和晚上才有。现在这个时间只有8路车。\n本：好的。谢谢你！",
    "traditional": "3路車去圖書館嗎\n\n本：你好！請問3路車去圖書館嗎？\n公交司機：不去。去圖書館可以坐5路車、7路車和8路車。\n本：好的。\n公交司機：啊，但是今天是週日，沒有5路車。7路車早上和晚上才有。現在這個時間只有8路車。\n本：好的。謝謝你！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Does bus number 3 go to the library?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：你好！请问3路车去图书馆吗？",
      "traditional": "本：你好！請問3路車去圖書館嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ hǎo qǐng wèn sān lù chē qù tú shū guǎn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello! May I ask if bus number 3 goes to the library?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "公交司机：不去。去图书馆可以坐5路车、7路车和8路车。",
      "traditional": "公交司機：不去。去圖書館可以坐5路車、7路車和8路車。",
      "pinyin": "gōng jiāo sī jī bú qù qù tú shū guǎn kě yǐ zuò wǔ lù chē qī lù chē hé bā lù chē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Chauffeur: It does not. To go to the library, you can take bus number 5, 7 or 8."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：好的。",
      "traditional": "本：好的。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "公交司机：啊，但是今天是周日，没有5路车。",
      "traditional": "公交司機：啊，但是今天是週日，沒有5路車。",
      "pinyin": "gōng jiāo sī jī a dàn shì jīn tiān shì zhōu rì méi yǒu wǔ lù chē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "7路车早上和晚上才有。",
      "traditional": "7路車早上和晚上才有。",
      "pinyin": "qī lù chē zǎo shang hé wǎn shang cái yǒu",
      "english": "Chauffeur: Ah, but today is Sunday, so there’s no number 5 bus."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "现在这个时间只有8路车。",
      "traditional": "現在這個時間只有8路車。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài zhè ge shí jiān zhǐ yǒu bā lù chē",
      "english": "Bus number 7 only runs in the morning and evening."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "At this hour, there’s only bus number 8."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：好的。谢谢你！",
      "traditional": "本：好的。謝謝你！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok. Thank you!"
    }
  ],
